| Long-Form Creator | Thread slows +10% / Pinned Reply damage +50 | Attention Span +150 range / Breaking News cooldown −20 s | Thread lasts a second longer / Pinned Reply stacks on reapply | Breaking News marks targets for allies / +1 Clout per second while seen |
| Lurk Mode | Unseen Mention +25% damage / Dark Mode radius +50 | Cold Open cooldown −3 s / Ghost Post +1 s invisible | Unseen Mention refreshes on kill / Dark Mode slows | Ghost Post earns no Clout / LIVE hidden for 10 s after each kill |
| Retargeting | Lead Magnet bounces once / Cold Outreach +30 damage | Stealth Mode +1 s / Tracked Post pays +10 gold | Tracked Post reveals for 4 s / Lead Magnet briefly stuns | Each tracked enemy gets a Spoiler Tag / Cold Outreach resets Stealth Mode |
| Who Asked | Cold Read slows +15% / Off the Record cooldown −4 s | Wall of Text +1 s / Hot Take Drop radius +100 | Cold Read freezes for 0.5 s / Off the Record heals 10% | Hot Take Drop marks the target for 2 s / Enemies silenced for 1 s on cast |
| Well Actually | Citation Needed hits one more target / Hard Correction +1 s | Drain Thread amplifies damage / Corrected targets lose attack speed | Citation Needed slows +20% / Source? +200 damage | Attacks on casters deal bonus damage / One correction per fight costs no mana |
| Debate Bro | Rebuttal +10 damage / Quick Reply cooldown −2 s | Block Button +1 s / Void Post radius +50 | Rebuttal heals 5% / Quick Reply leaves an afterimage for 40 damage | Void Post hits twice / Mana regen doubles above 50 Clout |
